th=\"678\" height=\"67\">", "option1": "2 zeros, each of order 1", "option2": "2 zeros, each of order 2", "option3": "1 zero of order 4", "option4": "No zeros", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceclip1_YO1dk5v.png\" width=\"652\" height=\"115\"></p>"}]}, "_source": "archive-question-subject", "_exam_id": 12102, "custom_field": "প্রতি প্রশ্নের মান ১ ও ভুল উত্তরের জন্য ০.৫০ কাটা যাবে।", "exam_time": "2700000", "is_omr": true, "omr_time": "3000000", "examname": "Sep 08, 2025", "type": "Math-Sub-561-applied", "payment": "BALANCE_NOT"}